  "releaseNotes": "Add child layout support and offset handling:\n      - Introduce nested/child layout support by adding _childIndex and _parentOffset and a computed _baseOffset used to virtualize payload positions.\n      - Methods that read/write headers and payloads (ReconstructLayout, Attach, Read/Write functions) now use _baseOffset.\n      - Added GetChildLayout to create child views, UpdateOffsetTable and helper getters for parent headers, and adjusted Buffer.Shift handling to update parent and child offset tables.\n      - Prevent disposing of a shared parent Buffer in child views (Reset/Attach changes). Also add a generic LayoutModel<T> : LayoutModel implementing Dispose to return instances to the pool.",
